# v01.0: Rate limit the task API

Plan: [feature-rate-limit](../.tmp/plans-archive/feature-rate-limit.md)
Pull request: #41

The task endpoints answered every request they received, so one client could
spend the whole budget the rest of them share.

## Outcomes

- [x] Outcome: a client over the request budget is rejected
- [x] Outcome: the budget resets on a rolling window

## Findings

- The window is per client rather than global, so the counter is keyed by the
  caller rather than by the route.

> Test strategy: unit, drive the limiter past the budget and past the window.
